meta {
  name: 02_ResourceDelegationValidation
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Scenario: The resource delegation endpoints reject invalid input and foreign resources

    When the rights for an unknown resource are looked up the request fails
    When a right is delegated without right keys the request fails
    When an unknown resource is delegated the request fails
    When another service owner revokes a delegation on the resource the request is forbidden
    When the token lacks the resource delegation scope the request is forbidden

  None of the steps writes anything: every request is rejected before a delegation is
  created or removed, so the scenario needs no reset or cleanup.
}
